[offset:00:00:55]
[00:01.22]When the crowd comes running and sees your name in lights
[00:08.03]Does the sound still scare you? Do I still cross your mind?
[00:15.18][00:22.04][00:59.97][01:06.64](Shiny chariot!) I wonder what it feels like
